,40,'1','1',1,'0','0',7,'default_3x3','catalog_dimmers_header1_es','dimmers_teaser','','Give reverse the lighting of your room by simply pressing a switch or fuse panel!','','','','','','','0','',''),(1015,9,'Camas',1,114,'1','1',1,'0','0',4,'default_3x3','camas','camasteaser','','At some point need to rest, so what better to do it in a good comfortable bed!','','Click on an item for more information.','','','','','0','',''),(27,1011,'Christmas',1,64,'1','1',1,'0','0',4,'default_3x3','catalog_xmas_headline1','xmas2009_catalogue','catalog_special_txtbg2','Get yourself into the Christmas spirit with our selection of festive furni! From baubles to Reindeer poo, we\'ve got it all!','','Click on an item for more information.','\'tis the season!','','','','0','',''),(28,1011,'Arctic',0,13,'1','1',1,'0','0',5,'default_3x3','catalog_arc_header1_en','catalog_arc_teaser1_en','','Stay cool (or warm with out campfire!) with and create your own Winter Wonderland or Humble Homeland for your Penguins.','','Click on an item for more information.','','','','','0','',''),(29,3,'Doors',0,58,'1','1',1,'0','0',10,'default_3x3','catalog_doors_headline1_es','catalog_door_a','catalog_special_txtbg1','Private Rooms Change the speed of light! By purchasing, you will receive two Teleports to put in different rooms so he can travel between them.','','','Â¡Lleva a tu habitaciÃ³n al siguiente nivel!','','','','0','',''),(30,3,'Mode',0,39,'1','1',1,'0','0',17,'default_3x3','catalog_mode_headline1_es','catalog_mode_teaser1','','Functionality and design? Into one? These are reserved for members Furni who feel untouchable and confident. Do you have style or not?','','','Â¡No veas cÃ³mo brilla!','','','','0','',''),(31,1011,'Candy',0,19,'1','1',1,'0','0',100,'default_3x3','catalog_candy_headline1','catalog_candy_teaser1','catalog_special_txtbg2','A bit more feminine than \'Mode\', this will add a bit of glamour and glitz to your rooms. Lacking a few items? Head on over to the \'Mode\' catagory!','','